 "summary": "BAT54WS is a Schottky barrier rectifier in the two-lead SOD-323 surface-mount case, marked L9. It is rated 30 V reverse and 200 mA average forward current, with forward voltage of 240 mV max at 0.1 mA and 400 mV max at 10 mA, reverse recovery of 6 ns max and capacitance of 10 pF max at 1 V. Application: low-voltage, high-frequency signal circuits.",
